Bind Npc 26057 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910056000
        Say "I am the Keeper, the guardian of the Seventh key! You possess the [Sixth Key], so you are qualified to hear the question. Will you accept the challenge?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What is the name of the mountain range that Xigenon crossed with his men?"
            Topic "Eslant Mountain Range" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910056000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. As a penalty, the [Sixth Key] you possessed has been destroyed. Now, I will leave to search for the secret of the keys elsewhere."
            Topic "Iskant Mountain Range" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910056000
                    Give 1 of 910057000
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I am the Keeper, the Guardian of the Seventh Key! I only pose questions to those who bring the [Sixth Key]"
    Else
        Say ""
